WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.714
- When people find out I'm
Vietnamese, this always happens.

00:00:03.714 --> 00:00:05.714
- Oh my God! I love pho!

00:00:07.587 --> 00:00:10.558
- It's pronounced "fuh"
and yeah it's delicious.

00:00:10.558 --> 00:00:12.326
But today I wanna spend some time talking

00:00:12.326 --> 00:00:16.337
about some other things that
makes being Vietnamese awesome.

00:00:16.337 --> 00:00:19.237
(bright music)

00:00:19.237 --> 00:00:22.469
Like, aside from pho, we have
some other amazing dishes too.

00:00:22.469 --> 00:00:23.651
- What do you recommend?

00:00:23.651 --> 00:00:26.236
- Personally, my favorites
are the bún bò huế,

00:00:26.236 --> 00:00:29.122
the bánh xèo and the Cơm tấm.

00:00:29.122 --> 00:00:32.613
Also, fish sauce is the nectar of the Gods

00:00:32.613 --> 00:00:36.341
and it makes all our food
taste that much better.

00:00:36.341 --> 00:00:39.643
- Hmm, could use some fish sauce.

00:00:39.643 --> 00:00:40.692
- We're able to speak Vietnamese

00:00:40.692 --> 00:00:43.305
when we don't want people
around us understanding us.

00:00:43.305 --> 00:00:44.797
- [Man In Short Sleeve] Oh,
potatoes, I love potatoes.

00:00:44.797 --> 00:00:45.880
French fries.

00:00:51.148 --> 00:00:53.007
- On top of the universal holidays,

00:00:53.007 --> 00:00:55.529
we also have Vietnamese holidays.

00:00:55.529 --> 00:00:57.489
That's double the festive.

00:00:57.489 --> 00:00:59.428
- Hey, are you free February 16th?

00:00:59.428 --> 00:01:01.639
- Ah, I can't. It's New Year's.

00:01:01.639 --> 00:01:03.235
- New Year's was the 1st.

00:01:03.235 --> 00:01:07.393
- I know that, I'm talking about
Tet. Vietnamese New Year's?

00:01:07.393 --> 00:01:09.599
You know you can't expect this to happen

00:01:09.599 --> 00:01:11.088
at the next family gathering.

00:01:11.088 --> 00:01:12.845
- [Guest] Kevin
- Hey, Victor.

00:01:12.845 --> 00:01:14.795
- Oh my gosh. Is that..?

00:01:14.795 --> 00:01:17.632
- Paris by Night? Yeah,
you know how yulin is.

00:01:17.632 --> 00:01:18.760
- Of course I do.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:19.799
- Vietnamese people are some one of

00:01:19.799 --> 00:01:21.456
the hardest working people I know.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:23.245
I've seen families do incredible things

00:01:23.245 --> 00:01:25.125
from very little and
they've taught me a lot

00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:27.866
about courage, perseverance and love.

00:01:27.866 --> 00:01:30.074
And for me the best part
about being Vietnamese

00:01:30.074 --> 00:01:33.984
is our strong sense of
community and family.

00:01:33.984 --> 00:01:37.062
Oh, and did I mention how
folklore says Vietnamese people

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:40.363
are the descendants of
a fairy and a dragon?

00:01:40.363 --> 00:01:42.125
Yeah, we're magical baby.

00:01:42.125 --> 00:01:44.708
(bright music)

